"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">31</div><h1>수동태</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Das Passiv</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 31의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">능동문을 werden + 과거분사의 수동문으로 바꾸고, 3격은 그대로 둬요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">수동의 현재·과거·현재완료·과거완료를 만들고 worden과 geworden을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">von·durch, 화법조동사 + 수동, 주어 없는 수동을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">werden(과정)과 sein(상태)을 구별하고, sich lassen·sein … zu·-bar로 바꿔 말해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> In der Bäckerei nebenan <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gerade frisches Brot gebacken, es riecht herrlich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) wird</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gerade(지금 하는 중)는 일어나는 과정이라 werden 수동이에요.<br>주어 frisches Brot가 단수라서 wird예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;werden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Pakete <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> morgen früh abgeholt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 소포들은 내일 아침에 수거돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Pakete <b>werden</b> morgen früh abgeholt.</div>수동은 werden + 과거분사예요.<br>주어 die Pakete가 복수라서 werden이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wird&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Man renoviert gerade das Rathaus. → Das Rathaus <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> gerade renoviert.</div><div class=\"qko\">시청이 지금 보수되고 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man renoviert gerade das Rathaus. → Das Rathaus <b>wird</b> gerade renoviert.</div>능동문의 4격 목적어 das Rathaus가 수동문의 주어가 돼요.<br>man은 사라지고, 단수 주어라서 wird예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;worden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Brücke ist letzten Sommer komplett erneuert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 다리는 지난여름에 완전히 새로 고쳐졌어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Brücke ist letzten Sommer komplett erneuert <b>worden</b>.</div>수동의 현재완료는 sein + 과거분사 + worden이에요.<br>geworden은 '~이 되다'의 과거분사라서 여기에는 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wurde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Das erste Fahrrad <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> 1817 in Mannheim erfunden.</div><div class=\"qko\">최초의 자전거는 1817년에 만하임에서 발명됐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das erste Fahrrad <b>wurde</b> 1817 in Mannheim erfunden.</div>역사 속 사실은 과거 수동으로 많이 써요.<br>werden의 과거형 wurde + 과거분사 erfunden.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Man dankt den Helfern herzlich. → <span class=\"qblank\"></span> wird herzlich gedankt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Der Helfer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Den Helfern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Dem Helfern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Helfer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">danken은 3격 동사라서 수동문에서도 3격 den Helfern이 그대로 남아요.<br>주어가 없으니 werden은 3인칭 단수 wird예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;von der&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Das Fest wird jedes Jahr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(von · ~에 의해 · Stadt · 여성)</span> Stadt organisiert.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 축제는 매년 시가 주최해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Fest wird jedes Jahr <b>von der</b> Stadt organisiert.</div>행위자는 von + 3격으로 나타내요.<br>die Stadt → von der Stadt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Die Bewohner wurden mitten in der Nacht <span class=\"qblank\"></span> einen lauten Knall geweckt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) durch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) von</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">잠을 깨운 원인은 durch + 4격이에요 — durch einen lauten Knall.<br>von은 3격과 쓰니까 einen과 맞지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;eingereicht&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Die Bewerbung muss bis Ende des Monats <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(einreichen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">지원서는 이달 말까지 제출돼야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Bewerbung muss bis Ende des Monats <b>eingereicht</b> <b>werden</b>.</div>화법조동사와 수동을 함께 쓰면 끝에 과거분사 + werden이 와요.<br>einreichen은 분리동사라서 eingereicht예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;In diesem Raum dürfen keine Handys benutzt werden&quot;,&quot;Keine Handys dürfen in diesem Raum benutzt werden&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 방에서는 휴대폰을 쓰면 안 돼요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Handys</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">benutzt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">diesem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Raum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">In</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">keine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">dürfen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">werden</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>In diesem Raum dürfen keine Handys benutzt werden.</b></div>화법조동사 dürfen이 두 번째 자리에 오고, 끝에는 과거분사 + werden이 와요.<br>주어 keine Handys가 복수라서 dürfen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Keine Sorge, die Fahrkarten <span class=\"qblank\"></span> schon bezahlt. Wir können direkt einsteigen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) haben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) worden</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이미 끝나서 그대로인 상태는 sein + 과거분사예요 — 결제돼 있어요.<br>werden은 지금 일어나는 과정에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wurde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Auf der Hochzeit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> bis drei Uhr morgens getanzt.</div><div class=\"qko\">결혼식에서는 새벽 세 시까지 춤을 췄어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Auf der Hochzeit <b>wurde</b> bis drei Uhr morgens getanzt.</div>tanzen은 4격 목적어가 없어서 주어 없는 수동이에요. werden은 3인칭 단수예요.<br>지난 일이라 과거형 wurde를 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> In unserer WG <span class=\"qblank\"></span> abends oft zusammen gekocht.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wird es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) wird</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어 없는 수동이라 werden은 3인칭 단수 wird예요.<br>첫 자리에 In unserer WG가 있으니 es는 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zu lesen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Die Schrift auf dem Zettel ist so klein, sie ist kaum <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(lesen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">쪽지의 글씨가 너무 작아서 거의 읽을 수가 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Schrift auf dem Zettel ist so klein, sie ist kaum <b>zu lesen</b>.</div>sein + zu 부정형은 '~될 수 있다'라는 수동의 뜻이에요.<br>kaum zu lesen은 '거의 읽을 수 없어요'라는 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Ist das Leitungswasser in dieser Gegend <span class=\"qblank\"></span>?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) trinkbar</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) getrunken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) trinkt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) trinkbare</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동사 어간 + bar는 '~할 수 있는'이라는 형용사예요 — trinkbar 마실 수 있는.<br>sein 뒤의 형용사라서 어미가 붙지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Fenster müssen einmal im Jahr geputzt werden&quot;,&quot;Einmal im Jahr müssen die Fenster geputzt werden&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">창문은 일 년에 한 번 닦아야 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Fenster</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Jahr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">geputzt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">werden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">einmal</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Fenster müssen einmal im Jahr geputzt werden.</b></div>müssen이 두 번째 자리, 끝에는 geputzt werden이 와요.<br>주어 die Fenster가 복수라서 müssen이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;worden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Man hat die Straße wegen eines Unfalls gesperrt.<br>→ Die Straße <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> wegen eines Unfalls gesperrt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 도로는 사고 때문에 통제됐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man hat die Straße wegen eines Unfalls gesperrt.<br>→ Die Straße <b>ist</b> wegen eines Unfalls gesperrt <b>worden</b>.</div>능동 현재완료(hat … gesperrt)는 수동에서 ist … gesperrt worden이 돼요.<br>보조 동사는 늘 sein이고, 끝에 worden이 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sind&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Alle Teilnehmer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> rechtzeitig über die Änderung informiert worden.</div><div class=\"qko\">모든 참가자가 제때 변경 사항을 안내받았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Alle Teilnehmer <b>sind</b> rechtzeitig über die Änderung informiert worden.</div>worden이 있으니 수동의 현재완료예요. 보조 동사는 sein이에요.<br>주어 alle Teilnehmer가 복수라서 sind예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Dem&quot;],[&quot;wurde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Man schickte dem Kunden ein neues Gerät.<br>→ <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Kunde · 남성)</span> Kunden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> ein neues Gerät geschickt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 고객에게 새 기기가 보내졌어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man schickte dem Kunden ein neues Gerät.<br>→ <b>Dem</b> Kunden <b>wurde</b> ein neues Gerät geschickt.</div>받는 사람(3격)은 그대로 3격이에요 — dem Kunden(n-변화).<br>4격이던 ein neues Gerät가 주어가 되고, 과거라서 wurde예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Gestern <span class=\"qblank\"></span> der Flug wegen des dichten Nebels gestrichen werden.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) musste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wurde</button></div><div class=\"qe\">끝이 과거분사 + werden이면 앞에는 화법조동사가 와요.<br>어제 일이라 과거형 musste예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;werden&quot;],[&quot;ist&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Gerade <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden 또는 sein)</span> die Tische für das Abendessen gedeckt. In zehn Minuten <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden 또는 sein)</span> alles gedeckt, dann können wir essen.</div><div class=\"qko\">지금 저녁 식사를 위해 식탁을 차리는 중이에요. 10분 뒤면 다 차려져 있을 테니 그때 먹을 수 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Gerade <b>werden</b> die Tische für das Abendessen gedeckt. In zehn Minuten <b>ist</b> alles gedeckt, dann können wir essen.</div>gerade(지금 하는 중)는 과정 → werden 수동, 주어가 복수라 werden.<br>10분 뒤에 다 끝나 있는 모습은 상태 → sein 수동, alles는 단수라 ist.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir frieren weil die Heizung dringend repariert werden muss&quot;,&quot;Weil die Heizung dringend repariert werden muss frieren wir&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">난방기를 급히 고쳐야 해서 우리는 추워요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">werden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Heizung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">weil</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">frieren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">muss</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">dringend</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">repariert</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir frieren, weil die Heizung dringend repariert werden muss.</b></div>weil 절에서는 화법조동사 muss가 맨 끝으로 가요.<br>순서는 과거분사 → werden → muss예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sich&quot;],[&quot;korrigieren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Man kann den Fehler ganz einfach korrigieren.<br>→ Der Fehler lässt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ganz einfach <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 오류는 아주 간단히 고칠 수 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man kann den Fehler ganz einfach korrigieren.<br>→ Der Fehler lässt <b>sich</b> ganz einfach <b>korrigieren</b>.</div>sich lassen + 원형은 '~될 수 있다'라는 뜻이에요.<br>과거분사가 아니라 원형 korrigieren을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Nach dem Spiel wird laut gesungen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nach dem Spiel werden laut gesungen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nach dem Spiel wird es laut gesungen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nach dem Spiel ist laut gesungen geworden.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어 없는 수동은 3인칭 단수 wird예요.<br>첫 자리에 Nach dem Spiel이 있으면 es를 넣지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Der Antrag ist leider noch nicht bearbeitet geworden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Über das Thema wurde lange diskutiert.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Die neuen Regeln sind allen Mitarbeitern erklärt worden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Dem Patienten wurde sofort geholfen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">수동의 현재완료는 geworden이 아니라 worden이에요 → ist … bearbeitet worden.<br>helfen은 3격 그대로, diskutieren über는 주어 없는 수동이라 나머지는 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wurde&quot;],[&quot;war&quot;],[&quot;worden&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Gestern Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> in der Innenstadt ein Fahrraddieb festgenommen. Zuvor <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(과거완료)</span> er von einer Überwachungskamera gefilmt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\">. Die Polizei sagt: „Die Fahrräder können jetzt ihren Besitzern zurückgegeben <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.“</div><div class=\"qko\">어제 저녁 시내에서 자전거 도둑이 체포됐어요. 그 전에 그는 감시 카메라에 찍혔었어요. 경찰은 '자전거들을 이제 주인들에게 돌려줄 수 있어요.'라고 말해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Gestern Abend <b>wurde</b> in der Innenstadt ein Fahrraddieb festgenommen. Zuvor <b>war</b> er von einer Überwachungskamera gefilmt <b>worden</b>. Die Polizei sagt: „Die Fahrräder können jetzt ihren Besitzern zurückgegeben <b>werden</b>.“</div>① 뉴스의 지난 일 → 과거 수동 wurde.<br>② 체포보다 앞선 일 → 과거완료 수동 war … gefilmt worden.<br>③ 화법조동사 können + 과거분사 + werden.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Kannst du nachsehen ob das Paket schon abgeschickt worden ist&quot;,&quot;Kannst du nachsehen ob schon das Paket abgeschickt worden ist&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">소포가 벌써 발송됐는지 확인해 줄 수 있어요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nachsehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Kannst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ob</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Paket</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">abgeschickt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">worden</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Kannst du nachsehen, ob das Paket schon abgeschickt worden ist?</b></div>ob 절에서는 활용된 동사 ist가 맨 끝에 와요.<br>수동 현재완료의 순서는 과거분사 → worden → ist예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Den&quot;],[&quot;musste&quot;],[&quot;erklärt&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Man musste den Kindern alles zweimal erklären.<br>→ <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Kindern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> alles zweimal <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(erklären)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들에게는 모든 것을 두 번씩 설명해 줘야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man musste den Kindern alles zweimal erklären.<br>→ <b>Den</b> Kindern <b>musste</b> alles zweimal <b>erklärt</b> <b>werden</b>.</div>3격 den Kindern은 그대로 남고, 4격이던 alles가 주어가 돼요.<br>alles는 단수라서 musste, 끝에는 erklärt werden이 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> '이 문은 밖에서 열 수 없어요.'와 뜻이 다른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Tür ist von außen nicht zu öffnen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Tür kann von außen nicht geöffnet werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Die Tür muss von außen nicht geöffnet werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Tür lässt sich von außen nicht öffnen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">muss nicht geöffnet werden은 '밖에서 열 필요가 없다'라는 뜻이에요(10과의 nicht müssen).<br>sich lassen, sein … zu, können + 수동은 모두 '열 수 없다'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 빈칸에 geworden이 들어가는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Halle ist für das Konzert neu gestrichen ___.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der Vertrag ist gestern unterschrieben ___.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Den Nachbarn ist beim Umzug geholfen ___.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Mein Cousin ist letztes Jahr Vater ___.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Vater werden(아버지가 되다)는 본동사 werden이라 현재완료가 geworden이에요.<br>나머지는 과거분사가 있는 수동이라 worden이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"